# The test files that show a widget without waiting until it is exposed (#754),
# read by check-shown-widget-wait.py. One repository-relative path per line;
# `#` starts a comment.
#
# The list only shrinks: an entry may be removed, never added, and the check
# fails while a listed file no longer needs its entry. A file leaves the list
# with the change that makes its tests wait (showUntilExposed() from
# tests/helpers/shown_widget.h).

